These modules are optional extensions loaded by MiniMax H3 WebUI (note edition).
They depend on the WebUI's core cells and do not run on their own. The core
WebUI (notebook cells 1–3) is NOT part of this repository and is distributed
separately under its own license terms.

This is an unofficial, community-made project. It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or supported by MiniMax. No model weights are included.
