Copyright (c) 2026 MiniMax. All Rights Reserved.

modules/spark_attn.py downloads and imports Spark-H3 (https://github.com/zechengtang/Spark-H3,
Apache License 2.0) at a pinned commit at run time; its code is not copied into this repository.
Spark-H3's bundled sol_attn contains files derived from FlashAttention (BSD-3-Clause) and from
NVIDIA cuDNN Frontend (Apache License 2.0); see sol_attn/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md in that repository.

modules/ref_filters.py downloads and imports Video Depth Anything (https://github.com/DepthAnything/Video-Depth-Anything,
Copyright (2025) Bytedance Ltd. and/or its affiliates, Apache License 2.0) at a pinned commit at run time, and its
Small checkpoint (https://huggingface.co/depth-anything/Video-Depth-Anything-Small, Apache License 2.0) at a pinned
revision; neither is copied into this repository. The Base/Large checkpoints (CC-BY-NC-4.0) are not used.
It also uses torchvision's DeepLabV3 (MobileNetV3-Large) segmentation weights (BSD-3-Clause), downloaded by torchvision.

assets/camera3d/human_f.glb and human_m.glb are modified copies (textures removed, one flat gray material) of
"Universal Base Characters [Standard]" by Quaternius (https://quaternius.com), CC0 1.0 Universal; see
assets/camera3d/README.md and License_Quaternius_Standard.txt.
modules/camera3d.py loads three.js (https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js, MIT License, Copyright © 2010-2024
three.js authors) in the browser from cdn.jsdelivr.net at a pinned version; it is not copied into this repository.
